      "content": "For a child weighing 14kg, the standard dose is typically 10-15mg per kilogram, so you need about 140-210mg. Since your liquid is 160mg per 5ml, you will need to give him approximately 5ml to reach the recommended dose range. If you must use a spoon, aim for a measure equivalent to 5ml, but please be aware that measuring medicine with household spoons is very inaccurate.",
