      "role": "user",
      "content": "5ml seems like so little though, he's acting really miserable and it's like he can't get comfortable. are you sure that's enough? i feel like if i give him more like 10ml or even 15ml it might work better and actually break the fever. i just want him to stop crying. is there any danger in giving him a bit more just this once?",
